{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jiV1IKPbGv1795359130.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港超，東方3-0擊敗十人應戰的至尊沙田。</p><p></p><p>藍衫東方10分鐘開紀錄，阿朗素快出迎的門將一步，頂入空門，之後沙田的安沙，為阻止對方單刀，拉跌對手。球證翻看「VAR」後，直接給紅牌。沙田19分鐘起十人應戰。</p><p></p><p>到26分鐘，高華在角球攻勢中，近門補中，拉開兩球優勢，沙田隊員圍圈調整，但只是1分鐘後再失守，大久保優射成3-0，亦是半場比數。</p><p></p><p>換邊後沙田無再失波，但亦有龜谷宇護射失十二碼，維持輸0-3。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.598875+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:02.381767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:35.488723+00:00","content_hash":"890e1aa61c9bce0576a943134226b0336da6b8338d716456bdd28aec6ffb6248","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.598875+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}